## Integration with extraction pipeline

The UI must consume outputs from the extraction pipeline, not independent mock data.

Recommended CLI outputs:

```text
out/
  evidence/
    evidence.jsonl
  extraction/
    boreholes.json
    borehole_validation.json
  geospatial/
    crs_validation.json
    borehole_locations.json
    boreholes.geojson
    section_line.geojson
    stratigraphic_section.json
  review/
    integrated_review.html
```

### Suggested CLI commands

```bash
geotech vision report.pdf \
  --task borehole-log \
  --extract-coordinates \
  --quality accurate \
  --provider-profile glm_default \
  --strict \
  --save-artifacts \
  --output out/
```

```bash
geotech geo validate out/extraction/boreholes.json \
  --project-country GB \
  --crs auto \
  --output out/geospatial/crs_validation.json
```

```bash
geotech geo transform out/extraction/boreholes.json \
  --source-crs EPSG:27700 \
  --target-crs EPSG:4326 \
  --output out/geospatial/borehole_locations.json
```

```bash
geotech geo section out/extraction/boreholes.json \
  --line auto \
  --vertical-datum mAOD \
  --output out/geospatial/stratigraphic_section.json
```

```bash
geotech review build out/ \
  --template integrated \
  --output out/review/integrated_review.html
```

