## Provider-agnostic architecture

GLM is the default provider profile:

```text
OCR: GLM-OCR
Vision: GLM-5V-Turbo
Text / agent: GLM-5.1
```

But the UI must not depend on GLM-specific response shapes.

Provider outputs must be normalized before reaching the UI:

```ts
type NormalizedEvidence = {
  id: string;
  sourceModel: string;
  page: number;
  bbox: [number, number, number, number];
  rawText: string | null;
  normalizedText: string | null;
  cropRef?: string;
  confidence?: number;
};
```

The UI consumes only:

```text
IntegratedReviewModel
```

not raw model responses.

