## Acceptance criteria

The implementation is accepted only when:

```text
- Source evidence, field cards, strip log, map, and section all update from the same selected borehole.
- Every field card contains an evidence ID.
- Every source evidence box references an evidence ID.
- Every map marker includes source CRS coordinates and transformed lat/lon.
- CRS guardrail is visible before and beside map rendering.
- A-A′ section shows mini borehole log columns, not just vertical lines.
- Cross-section labels do not overlap at normal desktop width.
- Mobile layout collapses to one column cleanly.
- Integrated JSON matches the visible data.
- No LLM-generated drawing is used for final visualization.
```

